title: Recover commits after a hard reset
title-zh: 硬重置之后找回提交
---
# A recipes repository with two commits
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+hidden pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
> git add pancakes.md
> git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
+hidden cake.md
# Lemon cake
+end
> git add cake.md
> git commit -m "Add a lemon cake recipe"
+hidden soup.md
# Tomato soup
+end
> git add soup.md
> git commit -m "Add a tomato soup recipe"
$ git log --oneline
$ git reset --hard HEAD~2
$ git log --oneline
$ git reflog
$ git reset --hard ab03771
$ git log --oneline
